---
title: How to Switch Between List and Grid View?
sidebar:
  order: 5
---
**Easily view your services in the layout that suits you best. Taskip allows you to toggle between List and Grid views:**

1. **Go to the Taskip main menu and select Services.**
1. **At the top-right of the services page, click the List or Grid icon.**
1. **Your services will be displayed in the selected view.**
